Package: rgeodesy
Title: R Interface to Rust Geodesy
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Michael", "Sumner", , "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2471-7511"))
Description: Provides R bindings to the Rust Geodesy library by Thomas Knudsen,
    a platform for experiments with geodetic transformations and data flow.
    Exposes the pipeline operator model — compose transformations from named
    primitives such as 'utm', 'helmert', 'molodensky', and 'geo:in' adaptors —
    and apply them to vectors of coordinates. Useful for learning the RG
    architecture and for geodetic operations not available in PROJ-based tools.
